message: >-
  If you use EasyLocal in your research, please cite it as below.
title: EasyLocal
abstract: >-
  EasyLocal is a C++23 header-only framework for the design of local search
  algorithms and metaheuristics. Version 4 is a complete redesign of
  EasyLocal++.
type: software
version: 4.0.0
license: MIT
